{:edb/db-before-t 1085 :edb/db-after-t 1086 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534398 50 #inst "2026-10-07T00:14:59.462Z" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063973 1100 "Calculate the indefinite integral $\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\textrm{d}x$." 13194139534398 false] [17592186063973 1100 "Calculate the indefinite integral $\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\textrm{d}x.$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063973 1145 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\textrm{d}x = \\arcsin (x) + C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}}dx &= 3\\int\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}}dx \\\\\n&= 3\\arcsin (x) + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 false] [17592186063973 1145 "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\textrm{d}x = \\arcsin (x) + C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(x)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063974 1100 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{2}{1+x^2}\\textrm{d}x$." 13194139534398 false] [17592186063974 1100 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{2}{1+x^2}\\textrm{d}x.$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063974 1145 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+x^2}\\textrm{d}x = \\arctan{x} + C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\frac{2}{1 + x^{2}}dx &= 2\\int\\frac{1}{1 + x^{2}}dx \\\\\n&= 2\\arctan x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 false] [17592186063974 1145 "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+x^2}\\textrm{d}x = \\arctan{x} + C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{2}{1+{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x & =2\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063975 1100 "Evaluate the integral $\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac {x^2+2}{x^2 + 1}\\,  \\textrm{d}x.$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063975 1100 "Evaluate the integral $\\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac {x^2+2}{x^2 + 1}\\, \\textrm{d}x$." 13194139534398 false] [17592186063975 1145 "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit  to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}+2}{{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+1+1}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+1}{{x}^{2}+1}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =1+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{x^2+1} \\textrm dx = \\arctan(x),\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}+2}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x+\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063975 1145 "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{x^{2} + 2}{x^{2} + 1} &= \\frac{x^{2} + 1 + 1}{x^{2} + 1} \\\\\n&= \\frac{x^{2} + 1}{x^{2} + 1} + \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 1} \\\\\n&= 1 + \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 1}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{x^2+1} \\textrm dx = \\arctan(x)\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\frac{x^{2} + 2}{x^{2} + 1}dx &= \\int(1 + \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 1})dx \\\\\n&= \\int1dx + \\int\\frac{1}{x^{2} + 1}dx \\\\\n&= x + \\arctan (x) + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 false] [17592186063976 1100 "If $f'(x) = \\dfrac{5}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^2 - 1}} - 2x$, then $f(x)=$" 13194139534398 false] [17592186063976 1100 "If $f'(x) = \\dfrac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{x^2 - 1}} - 2x,$ then $f(x)=$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186063976 1145 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^2 - 1}} \\, \\textrm dx = \\textrm{arcsec} \\, x\n$$\n\nThen we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x) &= \\intf^{′}(x)dx \\\\\n&= \\int(\\frac{5}{\\mid x\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - 2x)dx \\\\ = \\int\\frac{5}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}dx - \\int2xdx \\\\ = 5\\int\\frac{1}{\\mid x\\end{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}dx - 2\\intxdx \\\\\n&= 5arcsec(x) - 2 \\cdot \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + C \\\\\n&= 5arcsec(x) - x^{2} + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 false] [17592186063976 1145 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{x^2 - 1}} \\, \\textrm dx = \\textrm{arcsec} \\, x.\n$$\n\nThen we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-2x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x-2\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\text{arcsec}\\,(x)-2\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =5\\text{arcsec}\\,(x)-{x}^{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186064086 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286217 13194139534398 true] [17592186064086 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286224 13194139534398 true] [17592186064086 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286264 13194139534398 true] [17592186064086 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286313 13194139534398 true] [17592186064098 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286196 13194139534398 true] [17592186064098 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286278 13194139534398 true] [17592186064098 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286299 13194139534398 true] [17592186064098 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286306 13194139534398 true] [17592186064099 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286203 13194139534398 true] [17592186064099 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286210 13194139534398 true] [17592186064099 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286271 13194139534398 true] [17592186064099 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286285 13194139534398 true] [17592186064099 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286292 13194139534398 true] [17592186064100 1020 #edb/ref 17592186286231 13194139534398 true] [17592186064100 1020 #ed