064456 1145 "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit  to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{3{x}^{2}+3-3}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3({x}^{2}+1)-3}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3({x}^{2}+1)}{{x}^{2}+1}-\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cancel{({x}^{2}+1)}}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}-\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =3-\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x,\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (3-\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\text{d}x-3\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3x-3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186286196 1017 #edb/ref 17592186286197 13194139534398 true] [17592186286196 1089 "q-114026" 13194139534398 true] [17592186286196 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534398 true] [17592186286196 1100 "$\\int \\frac{-2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186286196 1113 #uuid "81a9ab0f-86db-553a-87df-8490af19812d" 13194139534398 true] [17592186286196 1145 "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{-2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =-2\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534398 true] [17592186286197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286198 13194139534398 true] [17592186286197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286199 13194139534398 true] [17592186286197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286200 13194139534398 true] [17592186286197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286201 13194139534398 true] [17592186286197 1000 #edb/ref 1759218